# Production build config for the COLOCATED backend (see supabase/colocation/).
# Both values are PUBLIC by design and safe to commit and ship in the client
# bundle: the Supabase publishable (anon) key can only call the potluck_* RPC
# functions, and every table is RLS deny-all. To point the app at a different
# Supabase project, override these as Vercel project env vars (which take
# precedence over this file) or edit them here.
